<http://example.org/ns/alice> <http://example.org/ns/has\u0020space> "local name that cannot be a PN_LOCAL" .
<http://example.org/ns/alice> <http://example.org/ns/joined> "2020-01-02T03:04:05.000000Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
